 "text": "AI Accelerator +\nLOG IN\nAI Accelerator +\n3:19\nPrivate\n36 members\n$149/month\nBy Nick Puruczky\n🚀 Build a profitable AI business within 90 days.\nLearn to build beginner-to-advanced AI systems, package a proven offer, and land your first paying client—without coding experience or an audience.\nI run a ~$70k/mo AI agency, have worked with 60+ companies, and helped drive $5M+ for clients. AIA+ turns what works into one clear path.\nWHAT YOU GET:\n✅ CAOS: our Client Acquisition Operating System—Offer → Proof → Pipeline → Client\n✅ 3-Day AI Business Launch Challenge + personalized roadmap review\n✅ 90-Day AI Agency Roadmap\n✅ Claude Code, Codex, n8n, automation & AI-agent training\n✅ Proven offers + client-ready system demos\n✅ Outreach scripts, proposals, pricing & sales assets\n✅ Personalized business audit + weekly accountability\n✅ Weekly masterclasses, build support + annual 1:1 strategy call\n🛡️ ANNUAL MEMBER GUARANTEE:\nFollow the roadmap and land your first paying client within 90 days—or your money back.\nStop collecting tutorials. Start building systems people will pay for.\nPrivacy and terms\nAI Accelerator +\nskool.com/theaiaccelerator\nBuild a profitable AI business within 90 days.\nStep-by-step roadmap, AI system training, weekly coaching, sales assets & lead-gen playbooks.\n36\nMembers\n4\nOnline\n4\nAdmins\nJOIN $149/month\nPowered by",
